<title>HUNGARY: Hungary June ind. output up 3.8 pct m/m - prelim.</title>
<headline>Hungary June ind. output up 3.8 pct m/m - prelim.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output in June was 3.8 percent up month-on-month, and up 15.1 percent year-on-year, according to preliminary figures released by the Central Statistical Office on Monday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT</p>
<p>					June 1997   May 1997   June 1996</p>
<p>   Month-on-month change (pct)   +3.8	-1.7	  -7.8</p>
<p>   Year-on-year change (pct)    +15.1	+1.7	  -0.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Final, detailed figures will be released on August 13.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
